    "name": "FLAAK TD",
    "steam_appid": 3285780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/796262514e1e395c564897a6a906a8d9.poster.avif?t=1731080880\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/796262514e1e395c564897a6a906a8d9.webm?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/796262514e1e395c564897a6a906a8d9.mp4?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLAAK TD is a special kind of tower defense game. It is a AIR TOWER DEFENSE GAME.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the second world war, Germany was under constant aerial bombardment by the british and US air force. The bombing had one main objective: destroy the WAR MACHINE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Oberst in the Werhmacht and you command one of the numerous anti-aircraft brigade in charge of the air defense of several strategic site such as factories, Bridges or battleship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ennemies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face waves (RAID) of light bomber such as SBD Dauntless armed with one 500 LBS bomb, the powerful twin engine medium bomber B26 Marauder and the huge B17 4 engine heavy bomber all charged with 500LBS bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light bomber are faster but cause less damage than the medium bomber. If the bombers succeeded to destroy the strategic site. The game will be over for you Oberst!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/b64a5b8a41c3cc91d3c5c0533d1e9a78.poster.avif?t=1731080880\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/b64a5b8a41c3cc91d3c5c0533d1e9a78.webm?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/b64a5b8a41c3cc91d3c5c0533d1e9a78.mp4?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you have an arsenal to defend the site:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can install:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Light anti aircraft gun such as FlakVierling 28 for rapid fire but short range and low damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy anti-aircraft gun such as Flak 88mm gun with long range and high damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also call 3 powerful fighter planes Focke wulf 190 from the nearest\u00a0jagdgeschawader, they shoot down all planes in front of them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, you are also able to order fast reparation by the reparation team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don' forget to send the reparation team when it is needed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ask you to make choice and manage your ressource wisely in order to see the end of the raid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more planes you shoot the more money and power will be given to you in order to call reinforcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your duty to defend at all cost our factories against the allies raid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0For the fatherland! GOOD LUCK Oberst!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/796262514e1e395c564897a6a906a8d9.poster.avif?t=1731080880\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/796262514e1e395c564897a6a906a8d9.webm?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/796262514e1e395c564897a6a906a8d9.mp4?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLAAK TD is a special kind of tower defense game. It is a AIR TOWER DEFENSE GAME.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the second world war, Germany was under constant aerial bombardment by the british and US air force. The bombing had one main objective: destroy the WAR MACHINE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Oberst in the Werhmacht and you command one of the numerous anti-aircraft brigade in charge of the air defense of several strategic site such as factories, Bridges or battleship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ennemies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face waves (RAID) of light bomber such as SBD Dauntless armed with one 500 LBS bomb, the powerful twin engine medium bomber B26 Marauder and the huge B17 4 engine heavy bomber all charged with 500LBS bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light bomber are faster but cause less damage than the medium bomber. If the bombers succeeded to destroy the strategic site. The game will be over for you Oberst!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/b64a5b8a41c3cc91d3c5c0533d1e9a78.poster.avif?t=1731080880\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/b64a5b8a41c3cc91d3c5c0533d1e9a78.webm?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285780/extras/b64a5b8a41c3cc91d3c5c0533d1e9a78.mp4?t=1731080880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you have an arsenal to defend the site:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can install:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Light anti aircraft gun such as FlakVierling 28 for rapid fire but short range and low damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy anti-aircraft gun such as Flak 88mm gun with long range and high damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also call 3 powerful fighter planes Focke wulf 190 from the nearest\u00a0jagdgeschawader, they shoot down all planes in front of them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, you are also able to order fast reparation by the reparation team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don' forget to send the reparation team when it is needed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ask you to make choice and manage your ressource wisely in order to see the end of the raid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more planes you shoot the more money and power will be given to you in order to call reinforcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your duty to defend at all cost our factories against the allies raid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0For the fatherland! GOOD LUCK Oberst!</p>",
    "short_description": "Each day the US air force send wave after wave of bomber to crush our War machine. You are one anti-aircraft Brigade commander equiped with flakwierling 38 and the awesome Flak 88mm gun. Install them wisely and shoot all the bombers! Protect our factories and the fatherland!",
